  "_comment": "AWS Config managed-rule mapping for CMMC 2.0 Level 1. Two upstream inputs are joined here: the conformance-pack template (which carries the rule set, its default parameters, and resource scopes but no control ids) and the AWS Config Developer Guide mapping table (which carries control-id -> rule associations but no parameters). Control ids in aws_config_mapping use the 800-171-style numbering AWS publishes; the compiler joins them to CMMC final-rule ids via the 800-171 R2 crosswalk in cfr-170-crosswalk.json.",
